		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=6945#p6945"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Faire une addition :</p><p>date &#039;2001-09-28&#039; + time &#039;03:00&#039;&#160; resultat &#160; &#160; timestamp &#039;2001-09-28 03:00&#039;</p>]]></content>
